			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "B.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "1050fed8-54a8-41a9-97c3-fb3a8aa605bb")
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify mirror)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "NFC VNFC high-side load switch - TPS22919 (SC-70-6). ISD 2nA typ / 20nA max @25C vs the 917's 10nA typ / 100nA max, so better where the card lives; its 800nA max applies only at +125C, where the 917 specifies nothing at all. IQ 8uA typ while ON is a one-shot, not a standing cost: provisioning runs once at cold boot (~157ms), i.e. 3.9uJ against a 9.8J tank. Pin-for-pin with the 917 on every net used - pin4 CT-float becomes NC-float, QOD->VOUT sanctioned (internal 24 ohm), active-HIGH ON. Losses: no reverse-current blocking, and a fixed 1.75ms ramp (NFC_SOFTSTART_US raised to 2000). AEC-Q100 exists as TPS22919QDCKRQ1; the 917 has no -Q1 in any package."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "B.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "f5be8c75-524e-4a21-9a81-b5a33839c213")
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify mirror)
			)
		)
